least I wasn't alone.","difficulty":0.4581,"maxRank":640,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4306337","text":"Paling tidak aku tidak seorang diri."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:thank_you_very_much","headword":"thank you very much","gloss":"terima kasih banyak","freqRank":657,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:1564","tatoeba:eng:2826699"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:1564","text":"Thank you very much!","difficulty":0.4518,"maxRank":657,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:365991","text":"Terima kasih banyak!"}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:2826699","text":"I thank you very much for your help.","difficulty":0.4838,"maxRank":657,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4149728","text":"Saya sangat berterimakasih atas bantuan Anda."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:make_a_mistake","headword":"make a mistake","gloss":"membuat kesalahan","note":"make, bukan do. \"do a mistake\" salah, dan ini pasangan kata yang harus dihafal utuh.","freqRank":670,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:1550057","tatoeba:eng:40401"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:1550057","text":"Anyone can make a mistake.","difficulty":0.4611,"maxRank":670,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:7153040","text":"Setiap orang bisa berbuat salah."}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:40401","text":"Anybody can make a mistake.","difficulty":0.4611,"maxRank":670,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:7153040","text":"Setiap orang bisa berbuat salah."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:take_a_break","headword":"take a break","gloss":"istirahat sebentar","freqRank":713,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:19776","tatoeba:eng:6346939"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:19776","text":"Let's take a break for coffee.","difficulty":0.4731,"maxRank":713,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4381829","text":"Mari istirahat dan minum kopi."}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:6346939","text":"We don't have time to take a break.","difficulty":0.4891,"maxRank":713,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:12918563","text":"Kita tidak punya waktu untuk beristirahat."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:pay_attention","headword":"pay attention","gloss":"memperhatikan","note":"Kata kerjanya pay, seolah-olah perhatian itu dibayar. Tidak ada padanan harfiahnya di bahasa Indonesia.","freqRank":725,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:3619337","tatoeba:eng:5252413"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:3619337","text":"I just wanted to see if you were paying attention.","difficulty":0.555,"maxRank":1678,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:3883507","text":"Aku hanya ingin tahu apakah kamu memperhatikan atau tidak."}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:5252413","text":"Always pay attention to your surroundings.","difficulty":0.6065,"maxRank":5612,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:11086327","text":"Selalu perhatikan sekitarmu."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:do_homework","headword":"do homework","gloss":"mengerjakan PR","freqRank":734,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:3878538","tatoeba:eng:7385253"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:3878538","text":"Do you like doing homework?","difficulty":0.467,"maxRank":734,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:3878545","text":"Kamu suka mengerjakan PR?"}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:7385253","text":"She hasn't done her homework.","difficulty":0.467,"maxRank":734,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:10062841","text":"Dia belum mengerjakan PR-nya."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:have_breakfast","headword":"have breakfast","gloss":"sarapan","note":"Kata kerjanya have, bukan eat. \"eat breakfast\" dimengerti tapi terdengar asing.","freqRank":780,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:2432207","tatoeba:eng:2644124"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:2432207","text":"Have you had breakfast?","difficulty":0.4629,"maxRank":780,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4963113","text":"Kamu sudah sarapan?"}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:2644124","text":"Have you had breakfast yet?","difficulty":0.4709,"maxRank":780,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4963113","text":"Kamu sudah sarapan?"}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:make_a_decision","headword":"make a decision","gloss":"mengambil keputusan","note":"Bahasa Indonesia \"mengambil\" keputusan, bahasa Inggris \"make\" — kebalikan dari tebakan harfiah.","freqRank":832,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:1849384"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:1849384","text":"Don't make a decision right now.","difficulty":0.4831,"maxRank":832,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:3871938","text":"Jangan buat keputusan sekarang!"}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:of_course","headword":"of course","gloss":"tentu saja","freqRank":843,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:433492","tatoeba:eng:388652"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:433492","text":"Of course.","difficulty":0.4519,"maxRank":843,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:3960167","text":"Tentu saja"}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:388652","text":"Of course she can speak English.","difficulty":0.4839,"maxRank":843,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:3978351","text":"Jelas dia bisa berbahasa Inggris."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:pick_up","headword":"pick up","gloss":"menjemput, mengambil","freqRank":848,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:267524","tatoeba:eng:2891805"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:267524","text":"Young children pick up words they hear very early on.","difficulty":0.4903,"maxRank":848,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:4552724","text":"Anak kecil dengan cepat mengingat kata yang ia dengar."}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:2891805","text":"Pick up the phone.","difficulty":0.4683,"maxRank":848,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:11200655","text":"Angkat teleponnya."}}]},{"id":"en:chunk:in_fact","headword":"in fact","gloss":"sebenarnya, malahan","freqRank":993,"band":2,"anchors":["tatoeba:eng:9772462","tatoeba:eng:3961367"],"examples":[{"id":"tatoeba:eng:9772462","text":"I'm not getting married this year. In fact, I might never get married.","difficulty":0.5383,"maxRank":993,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:11434202","text":"Aku tidak akan menikah tahun ini. Bahkan, mungkin aku tidak akan pernah menikah."}},{"id":"tatoeba:eng:3961367","text":"The individual stars in a constellation may appear to be very close to each other, but in fact they can be separated by huge distances in space and have no real connection to each other at all.","difficulty":0.8435,"maxRank":10803,"tr":{"id":"tatoeba:ind:10568868","text":"Bintang-bintang dalam rasi bintang mungkin terlihat sangat dekat satu sama lain, padahal mereka bisa jadi terpisah dengan jarak yang sangat jauh di luar angkasa dan tidak berhubungan sama sekali."}}]}]}